# obs_source_add_active_child / remove_active_child: replay the parent's current show_refs onto the child
# (the first activate_refs of them as MAIN, the rest AUX). A child that is (transitively) the parent, or the parent
# itself, is rejected (self-parenting additionally logs a warning).
kind par input video enum
create p par P
create c par C
create d par D
child p c
child c d
inc_active p
inc_showing p
state d
add_active_child d p
add_active_child p p
add_active_child p d
state d
remove_active_child p d
state d
